 "text": "Hi, how are you doing right now? Great hobby. There are so many great ones out there. Do you have favorite TV show or movie series? That can be a good jumping off point. Then there are podcasts just for that. For cooking, The Flavour Therapy is really fun and covers weird food history. For odd facts, You're Not So Smart is the lead dog. Not at first. Most people listen via your phone or earphones, so an app isn't needed. You can download a few episodes in advance as a backup though, just in case. Great idea. A series of short episodes, like ten five minute episodes, is very manageable. A full hour feels like huge ask.",
